Package: smoothkvm
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: SmoothKvm <noreply@example.com>
Depends: libc6
Recommends: xvfb, x11vnc, xfce4, wl-clipboard, xclip, libnotify-bin
Description: One keyboard and mouse across all your computers
 SmoothKvm lets a Windows PC's keyboard and mouse control this machine over an
 encrypted, paired connection. Installs a background service that starts on boot,
 plus the SmoothKvm terminal UI (type SmoothKvm). This computer can also control
 other paired screens: press Scroll Lock to jump to the next one. Clipboard text can
 be shared (off by default).
